    {
      "text": "Photograph of an inauguration at De Martino Hospital, Mogadishu, Somalia, dated 17 March 2022, with logos of the Somali Ministry of Health and Human Services, the European Union and WHO Somalia; a group of people stand beside an unveiled plaque for a Pressure Swing Adsorption Oxygen Plant.",
